known as mass hysteria. The textbook

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:42.770
definition of mass hysteria says it is a
form of mass contagion in which an

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:48.140
irrational belief or behavior grips a
group or community. The size of a small

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:52.640
town link Point Pleasant offered a
unique social environment. Residents

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:57.380
either had a Mothman story themselves or
knew someone who did which allowed the

00:09:57.380 --> 00:10:00.980
